Changes in version 2.31.1
------------------------

    * Added three pan-tissue DNA methylation reference matrices for eight cell types.
    * Added calculate_mFDI() and calculate_EMTS() for extrinsic mFDI and
      cell-intrinsic EpiEMT scoring, respectively.

Changes in version 2.27.1 (2026-02-04)
--------------------------------------

New features

    * Added a new function ConstructDNAMPanel to support custom DNA methylation panel construction.
